### Technical Context

**Application Architecture:**
- Micro-frontends: 6-10 independently deployed modules
- No shared build process or deployment coordination
- Modules may be at different versions in production
- Backend services: Domain-aligned microservices publishing backend events (EventBridge)

**Current State (Direct Module Communication):**

```typescript
// ❌ PROBLEM: Claims MFE directly imports Care Coordination API

// claims-mfe/src/services/claimSubmission.ts
import { triggerCaregapAnalysis } from '@gainwell/carecoord-mfe/api';  // Direct import!

async function submitClaim(claim) {
  const result = await claimsApi.submit(claim);

  // Direct call to Care Coordination module
  await triggerCaregapAnalysis(claim.memberId);  // Tight coupling!

  return result;
}

// Problems:
// 1. Build-time dependency: Claims module cannot deploy without Care Coordination
// 2. Breaking changes: Care Coordination API change breaks Claims module
// 3. Cannot add new subscribers without modifying Claims code
```

